{"3431190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galactic Realms: Quest for the Forgotten", "steam_appid": 3431190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/4e3fb815def4da930a55ca526ad811ff.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1400 height=373 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galactic Realms: Quest for the Forgotten is a first-person, 1–4 player co-op dungeon crawler and <strong><u>PvE-only</u></strong> extraction RPG where dark fantasy collides with forgotten technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up in a shared, persistent underground realm, then descend into an ever-changing dimensional rift dungeon powered by the <strong>Galactic Grid Matrix™</strong>, a modular system that stitches handcrafted zones into new layouts every expedition. Decide how far you’re willing to push for rarer loot… or extract before the dungeon takes it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>No pay-to-win. No microtransactions. No loot boxes.</strong></u> Your power comes from gameplay, skill, teamwork, and smart decisions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/3bb07aafe939d806ac245ab53f04e59b.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=202 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your loadout (and your Drake) in the underground realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the shifting rift dungeon - new layout every expedition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight brutal PvE threats, adapt on the fly, and claim rare loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose when to push deeper… and when to extract</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep what you extract with</strong> and everything else is at risk </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play for 20 minutes or 20 hours.</u></strong><u> Jump in for a quick extraction run or stay for a deep crawl.</u> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/a51064b7ce77a1e334c162a971a5e785.poster.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/a51064b7ce77a1e334c162a971a5e785.webm?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/a51064b7ce77a1e334c162a971a5e785.mp4?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t procedural “noise.” Every expedition rewrites itself from a rotating pool of handcrafted zones for each segment, reconnected through a dynamic grid logic, so no two runs play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Each expedition reshuffles each time you enter:</u></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Routes and room connections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters locations, enemy variation, and evolving modifier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot outcomes and risk/reward decisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/a87badf3846b22a0289584a5b2442172.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=248 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Going down can cost you your run but you may have options.</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-enter the dungeon to recover what you can and extract with it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your squad on a rescue and revive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But time is not on your side, and the dungeon doesn’t wait</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/8cf35cb7a0b98b51dfc6e7a2672eecca.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Quest for the Forgotten, <strong><u>you don’t pick a class</u></strong>. Your <strong>abilities</strong>, <strong>equipment</strong>, <strong>and choices</strong> shape how your character plays over time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills evolve through use and progress is mastery, not an XP grind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial character creation stat points choices help guide your focus (no path is locked)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract gear and artifacts to grow stronger across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build is defined by what you earn… and what you survive with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/c27616cac398482b4325b6cef9f35ef4.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=350 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, you return to a <strong><u>persistent underground world</u></strong> and not a menu lobby. It’s a mini-MMO-style experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a living cavern realm with a town, surrounding zones, and sprawling cave networks where multiple parties can be exploring and fighting at the same time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Player driven economy</u>, vendors, questing, planning, and loadout prep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Crafting and professions</u>. Turn hard-won resources into gear, tools, and long-term progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Open PvE camps</u>, roaming threats, and contested areas beyond the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realm where the light governs the world below, reshaping the land, changing the enemies, and what you can find.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/d7302e5d4096b0483bf9359ccc601745.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re building toward a world where the rift doesn’t stay contained and where threats can spill into the underground realm through large‑scale invasions and raid‑style events turning the “safe” world into the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>As development continues, the underground realm will grow:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More zones, caves, and contested PvE camps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World events and major threats that rally the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing districts and long-term identity systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Some features are planned for future updates; timing will be shared through official announcements.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/3874c602a9602f2d1a3a104f85b24482.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=346 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Drakes aren’t cosmetic pets. They’re companion characters that grow alongside you.</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Its own stat rolls</strong> and combat identity (no two are the same)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental resistances</strong> with strengths and vulnerabilities that matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>6 visible gear slots</u></strong> (Head, Neck/Chest, Gauntlets, Wing Guards, Tail Blade, Shoulders)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>100+ visual variants</u></strong>, made even more distinct by the gear you earn and craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills evolve through use</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Drake variants are released as <strong>limited legacy finds </strong>and as more are discovered, they become harder to uncover, keeping rarity meaningful through gameplay (not purchases).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/fb40d9c6208271af159518c0c85a84b4.poster.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1170 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/fb40d9c6208271af159518c0c85a84b4.webm?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/fb40d9c6208271af159518c0c85a84b4.mp4?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>No pay-to-win. No microtransactions.</strong> Your power comes from gameplay, skill, teamwork, and smart decisions.</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No in-game store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No premium currency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paid loot boxes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paid boosts or “convenience” power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No battle passes / paid reward tracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to support ongoing development through the base game (box price) and traditional expansions/content packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/7d39df95c62943290ae49c75af5e6bc3.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Wishlist now and follow for updates.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/99dda69d5c4fc4d7c7244106c51e1edc.poster.avif?t=1772953172\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/99dda69d5c4fc4d7c7244106c51e1edc.webm?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/99dda69d5c4fc4d7c7244106c51e1edc.mp4?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/4e3fb815def4da930a55ca526ad811ff.avif?t=1772953172\" width=14