sions</u>. Turn hard-won resources into gear, tools, and long-term progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Open PvE camps</u>, roaming threats, and contested areas beyond the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realm where the light governs the world below, reshaping the land, changing the enemies, and what you can find.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/d7302e5d4096b0483bf9359ccc601745.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re building toward a world where the rift doesn’t stay contained and where threats can spill into the underground realm through large‑scale invasions and raid‑style events turning the “safe” world into the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>As development continues, the underground realm will grow:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More zones, caves, and contested PvE camps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World events and major threats that rally the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing districts and long-term identity systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Some features are planned for future updates; timing will be shared through official announcements.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/3874c602a9602f2d1a3a104f85b24482.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=346 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Drakes aren’t cosmetic pets. They’re companion characters that grow alongside you.</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Its own stat rolls</strong> and combat identity (no two are the same)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental resistances</strong> with strengths and vulnerabilities that matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>6 visible gear slots</u></strong> (Head, Neck/Chest, Gauntlets, Wing Guards, Tail Blade, Shoulders)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>100+ visual variants</u></strong>, made even more distinct by the gear you earn and craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills evolve through use</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Drake variants are released as <strong>limited legacy finds </strong>and as more are discovered, they become harder to uncover, keeping rarity meaningful through gameplay (not purchases).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/fb40d9c6208271af159518c0c85a84b4.poster.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1170 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/fb40d9c6208271af159518c0c85a84b4.webm?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/fb40d9c6208271af159518c0c85a84b4.mp4?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>No pay-to-win. No microtransactions.</strong> Your power comes from gameplay, skill, teamwork, and smart decisions.</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No in-game store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No premium currency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paid loot boxes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paid boosts or “convenience” power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No battle passes / paid reward tracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to support ongoing development through the base game (box price) and traditional expansions/content packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/7d39df95c62943290ae49c75af5e6bc3.avif?t=1772953172\" width=1300 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Wishlist now and follow for updates.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/99dda69d5c4fc4d7c7244106c51e1edc.poster.avif?t=1772953172\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/99dda69d5c4fc4d7c7244106c51e1edc.webm?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/extras/99dda69d5c4fc4d7c7244106c51e1edc.mp4?t=1772953172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Magic meets forgotten tech in a first-person, 1-4 player co-op PvE-only extraction RPG and dungeon crawler. Descend into handcrafted, ever-changing dungeons, risk what you bring, claim rare loot, and extract to keep what you earn. No pay-to-win. No microtransactions.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/f1c69525b8fbc8666f184d945c7989433caefdfb/header.jpg?t=1772953172", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431190/677dc6aa19b054e078ea2bc592e4c64ca349975c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772953172", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akam